+# Third-party licensing
+
+## PanPhon
+
+`phonodist` depends on PanPhon at runtime.
+
+- Project: https://github.com/dmort27/panphon
+- License: MIT
+- Bundled here: no
+
+PanPhon is installed independently by the Python package manager.
+
+## PHOIBLE
+
+PHOIBLE may be used as a research/cross-checking source while developing
+language profiles.
+
+- Project: https://phoible.org/
+- License: CC BY-SA 3.0
+- Bundled here: no
+
+Do not copy or generate PHOIBLE-derived datasets into the Apache-2.0
+`phonodist` source tree without separately addressing the dataset license.
+
+## CLTS / pyclts
+
+CLTS and pyclts may be useful as future research or development-time
+cross-checks. They are not runtime dependencies of this scaffold.
